meta {
  name: Step-up enroll - revoke
  type: http
  seq: 17
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/step-up/enroll/revoke
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "identityRef": "nurse.compliant",
    "credentialId": "cred-never-enrolled"
  }
}

docs {
  Revokes one enrolled WebAuthn step-up credential. Same owner/operator privilege as enrolling. Fail-closed and idempotent: as sent (a credential id that was never enrolled), the fixture demo core answers 200 with revoked:false rather than a 404 that would let a caller distinguish "wrong id" from "already revoked" — see the api-server test suite for the full enroll -> revoke -> challenge-fails-closed round trip.
}
